    activationBkgColor: "#bbbbbb"
    activationBorderColor: "#6b7280"
    fontFamily: "ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif"
---
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant Client
  participant API as Poiesis API
  participant K8s as Kubernetes
  participant Pod as TaskPod
  participant TRec as trec sidecar
  participant TCtl
  participant PG as PostgreSQL

  Client->>API: POST /tasks
  API->>API: validate, assign UUID
  API->>PG: INSERT tasks (QUEUED)
  API->>K8s: create Job (TaskPod)
  API->>K8s: create PVC (owner=Job)
  API-->>Client: 200 {id}

  K8s->>Pod: schedule
  Pod->>TRec: start native sidecar
  TRec->>PG: state = RUNNING
  Pod->>Pod: tif → exec-0..N → tof
  TRec->>PG: executor_logs, system_logs
  Pod->>Pod: ack (main) exits 0
  K8s->>Pod: phase = Succeeded
  TRec->>PG: state = COMPLETE

  Note over TCtl,PG: Backstop reconciler runs continuously
  TCtl-->>PG: terminal write only if<br/>TRec couldn't self-report

  Client->>API: GET /tasks/{id}
  API->>PG: SELECT from tasks
  API-->>Client: 200 {state}
